full-query: "Your team is developing a feature that is used to enhance the production usage rate. A DynamoDB table has been implemented to trace relevant activities such as how the feature helps boosting the usage frequency. The table has about 2k new items every day and keeps increasing. Your PM wants to have a look at the daily data in this DynamoDB table. How do you present the data to PM in a proper way?"
